            (ii) on each of some 10 days during the calendar year or the preceding calendar year, each day being in a different calendar week, employed in agricultural labor (including labor performed by an alien referred to in subparagraph (B)) for some portion of the day (whether or not at the same moment of time) 5 or more individuals; and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section3306:b0030; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section3306(c)(1)(A)(ii); source-lines: 71-71; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope AgriculturalExcluded:
  definition days_exception equals
    if not (exists eid among (service_ids of world) such that
              (ent_ok of service, eid)
              and (is_agricultural_id of world, eid))
    then false
    else match caly with pattern
    -- Absent: false
    -- Present content y:
        exists ev among (W.service_event_values of world) such that
          (ent_ok of service, ev.ident)
          and (exists p among ev.patients such that
