declaration scope ExclStudentNurse:
  input world content W.World
  input service content optional of W.Entity
  input employer content optional of W.Entity
  input employee content optional of W.Entity
  input workday content optional of date
  ## s3306_c_13/4
  output holds content boolean
```



    (16) service performed in the employ of an international organization;


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section3306:b0043; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section3306(c)(16); source-lines: 101-101; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
