    (21) service performed by a person committed to a penal institution.

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section3306:b0044; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section3306(c)(21); source-lines: 103-103; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
scope ExclPenalInstitution:
  definition holds equals
    exists eid among (service_ids of world) such that
      (ent_ok of service, eid)
      and (exists a among (service_agents of world, eid) such that
             (ent_ok of employee, a)
             and (exists inc among (W.incarceration_event_values of world) such that
                    (W.optional_entity_equals of inc.agents, a)
                    and (exists jail among (W.entity_values of inc.patients) such that
                           exists pi among (W.penal_institution_event_values of world) such that
                             (W.optional_entity_equals of pi.agents, jail))
                    and (open_at of (W.date_values of inc.starts), (W.date_values of inc.ends), workday)))
```

